        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #34597.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2388837802\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34597\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/34597/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34597\">#34597</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Follow up from <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2394291251\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/34690\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/34690/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/34690\">#34690</a> to propagate the wording.</p>",
