        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is scope to make the following sentence in the Note (at the end of the page) a bit stronger to emphasize the issue that might be introduced unintentionally:<br>\n\"It can be quite easy to make text hard to read with text shadows.\"</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added a few other minor edits.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rephrase the note text to better convey the intended message</p>",
