            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Move three related gh live samples into the page.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">These are easier to maintain, and the complete code can be directly explored / broken out into the playground. Most of the code is already there, this adds the necessary bits to make it work as a live sample.</p>",
